&_nc_oc=Adr_-yiUGCulYWcdlq28XcC_jYfA0ev1kCe10H98rDH3aPcRQeCFGRlgVdslp029wcI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOp3h3Lu5rs7UMxkJka_-yex0hdaxUwL4xAmsEpQCDOBw&oe=6AE3633E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ayK0m3LDY94Q7kNvwHEpdCb&_nc_oc=AdqjQaXz8XILmLbVGQlBnohrsX_hjWE2gRNiAhCvGI17RcX_wUH6FTmQZQa-YmUU-Hw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOPHpH06PvPg9ARWcsNh-Hyn6kGvSBKIAUD6gKkPEqxHg&oe=6AE33BFC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_rT_iDSdYxUQ7kNvwHoy80E&_nc_oc=AdoeFaKTIxjXnyGF8d86PimXrzmgY4ddC-KJfFrGnLIP2R7pMDbp2dbJlKIdDHypcYw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOck406cKSEXGzDOOCPvUNZnaV1FSk_v_B54V7dIgbGMw&oe=6AE35A87"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yU5pIx19vjwQ7kNvwF7J5WN&_nc_oc=AdpbC7lJZ6psCsy-aPKuJ9Ia-wtNoHuPnWK7nc3XiYm8HludGQwOsjgqIPDphvzmsuY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPSj5QVtnFxD3g2nkdMmVbWd2azinASyjf46DT54QX5jA&oe=6AE34655"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MuOV1r2XUbwQ7kNvwF3-Ox0&_nc_oc=AdpTPSmRB-SkgU_UTcoqYtuXw6s8B3IbIiWRPT03mXgktfGm8R9_WyBxup4ec1TLA6U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMJ3Kn16NZq1BCX_p8qEbI961GVSCo751IL8gkE3Fb8yQ&oe=6AE352E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.